HOW TO CHANGE PASSWORD OF WAZUH

cd /usr/share/wazuh-indexer/plugins/opensearch-security/tools/
bash wazuh-passwords-tool.sh -u admin -p <desired Password>

Restart system services

sudo systemctl reload filebeat
sudo systemctl reload wazuh-dashboard
sudo systemctl reload wazuh-mananger

then wait 15-20 seconds for the wazuh dashboard server to load
